{"updated":"2026-10-23T17:37:21.874Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DeyeL2Mk7ht","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeyeL2Mk7ht","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"一個 2,700 多星的 AI 影片 repo，我把原始碼翻完：裡面沒有任何一行程式在「生成影片」。\n\nstickman-video-director 其實是一包給 AI agent 用的 Markdown 規則。你丟一個主題，它先給導演提案（旁白、分鏡、運鏡、音效），你確認後才吐出每段 10 秒的 Gemini Omni Flash prompt，影片再拿去 Google Flow 生、自己剪。5 種畫風、9:16 和 16:9 都能用。\n\n我覺得最值得偷的是兩個細節：\n\n1. 每段 prompt 都要把角色和配音描述整段重貼，規則明寫不准縮成「same narrator」。每段是獨立生成的，上一段寫過的，下一段等於沒寫。\n\n2. 它附了測試紀錄：沒裝 skill，5 次都是 agent 自己決定畫面比例；裝了之後，5 次都先停下來問你。\n\n比起一句 prompt 直接生影片，「先規劃、再生成」才是讓 AI 影片穩定的關鍵。","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:42:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeyeLy6kxv9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeyeLy6kxv9","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"GithubRepo:github.com/kaome…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」！\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:42:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeyLwcVE8Hz","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DeyLwcVE8Hz","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"個人agent比較表\n#Grok bot #Muse #Claude #Chatgpt","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:01:17.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"De1uQ--j-vT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/De1uQ--j-vT","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"有這樣的控制狂女友你幾點回家？\n\n1. 不准你進場看棒球，因為你只想去看啦啦隊。\n2. 會吃虛擬人物的醋，因為你說變裝角色很正。\n3. 禁止你去家庭理髮，因為你會被阿姨叫帥哥。\n4. 出差時會半夜突襲，因為KTV裡面可能有小姐。","timestamp":"2026-10-23T14:00:32.000Z","stats":{"likes":11,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"s